OL,3,AUK launch flood taskforce to prepare
OL,4,Afor extreme winter weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has launched a new
OL,7,Ftaskforce to respond to extreme
OL,8,Fweather, including the risk of flooding
OL,9,Fthis winter.
OL,11,FAfter a summer of record breaking
OL,12,Ftemperatures, the group will meet this
OL,13,Fweek to assess how prepared the UK is
OL,14,Ffor what the Met Office has described
OL,15,Fas the "heightened potential" for wet,
OL,16,Fwindy, stormy weather in the coming
OL,17,Fmonths.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
