OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUK launch flood taskforce to prepare
OL,4,Afor extreme winter weather
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're facing extreme weather, with
OL,7,Fflood and drought intertwined but the
OL,8,Fgovernment is taking decisive action,"
OL,9,FDepartment for Environment, Food and
OL,10,FRural Affairs (Defra) Minister Emma
OL,11,FHardy said in a statement ahead of the
OL,12,Fmeeting.
OL,14,FThe Environment Agency has warned
OL,15,Fapproximately 6.3 million homes and
OL,16,Fbusinesses in England remain at risk of
OL,17,Fflooding.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
